$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/books/42
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 14

book number 42

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/books/3/chapters/7
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 17

book 3, chapter 7

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/books/dune
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 43

Invalid URL: Cannot parse `dune` to a `u32`
